AfterClick license status

No new open-source or open-data license has been granted for the original
AfterClick source, manuscript, or research data. Rights remain with the respective
rights holders unless permission or a separate applicable license states otherwise.
This notice records the current status; it does not grant a new redistribution license.

Third-party code, fonts, benchmarks, dependencies, and other material retain their
own licenses and notices. See the preserved notices in the repository and evidence
archives. Model weights are referenced rather than redistributed.

A public release and selection of an open-source/data license remain separate
owner decisions. See research_ops/publication/DATA_AVAILABILITY.md.
